# .clang-tidy — SOS-05 M7 C port static-analysis configuration.
#
# Per SOS-05-CONCEPTS.md PCDN-SOS-05-005. The check list captures the
# classes of bugs that matter for embedded firmware (bug-prone patterns,
# CERT C compliance, portability) without inviting bikeshedding over
# style. WarningsAsErrors stays empty at v1 — warnings are upgrades-to-
# errors via a future amendment when the implementation surface has
# enough volume for a stable signal.

Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  misc-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-*,
  clang-analyzer-*

WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/include/sos/.*'
FormatStyle: file
